{"from":"1:1","body":"<p><ref to=\"2JN.1.1\">1</ref> He exhorts a certain honourable matron, with her children, to persevere in Christian love and belief,<br/><ref to=\"2JN.1.8\">8</ref> lest they lose the reward of their former profession;<br/><ref to=\"2JN.1.10\">10</ref> and to have nothing to do with those seducers that bring not the true doctrine of Christ Jesus.<br/><br/><br/>A. D. 90. A. M. 4094.<br/>elder.<br/><ref to=\"1PE.5.1 3JN.1.1\">1Pe 5:1; 3Jo 1:1</ref><br/>the elect lady.<br/><ref to=\"2JN.1.5 2JN.1.13 LUK.1.3 EPH.1.4 EPH.1.5 1TH.1.3 1TH.1.4 2TH.2.13 2TH.2.14 1PE.1.2\">5,13; Lu 1:3; Eph 1:4,5; 1Th 1:3,4; 2Th 2:13,14; 1Pe 1:2</ref><br/>whom.<br/><ref to=\"2JN.1.2 2JN.1.3 1PE.1.22 1PE.1.23 1JN.3.18 3JN.1.1\">2,3; 1Pe 1:22,23; 1Jo 3:18; 3Jo 1:1</ref><br/>known.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.8.32 GAL.2.5 GAL.2.14 GAL.3.1 GAL.5.7 COL.1.5 2TH.2.13 1TI.2.4 HEB.10.26\">Joh 8:32; Ga 2:5,14; 3:1; 5:7; Col 1:5; 2Th 2:13; 1Ti 2:4; Heb 10:26</ref><br/><ref to=\"1JN.2.21\">1Jo 2:21</ref></p>"}
{"from":"1:2","body":"<p>the truth's.<br/><ref to=\"1CO.9.23 2CO.4.5\">1Co 9:23; 2Co 4:5</ref><br/>which.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.15.7 COL.3.16 2TI.1.5 1PE.1.23-1PE.1.25 1JN.2.14 1JN.2.17\">Joh 15:7; Col 3:16; 2Ti 1:5; 1Pe 1:23-25; 1Jo 2:14,17</ref></p>"}
{"from":"1:3","body":"<p>Grace.<br/><ref to=\"ROM.1.7 1TI.1.2\">Ro 1:7; 1Ti 1:2</ref><br/>be. Gr. shall be. the Son.<br/><ref to=\"1JN.2.23 1JN.2.24 1JN.4.10\">1Jo 2:23,24; 4:10</ref><br/>in truth.<br/><ref to=\"2JN.1.1 ZEC.8.19 GAL.5.6 1TI.1.14 2TI.1.13\">1; Zec 8:19; Ga 5:6; 1Ti 1:14; 2Ti 1:13</ref></p>"}
