{"from":"1:6","body":"<p>this is love.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.14.15 JHN.14.21 JHN.15.10 JHN.15.14 ROM.13.8 ROM.13.9 GAL.5.13 GAL.5.14 1JN.5.3 1JN.5.15\">Joh 14:15,21; 15:10,14; Ro 13:8,9; Ga 5:13,14; 1Jo 5:3,15</ref><br/>This is the.<br/><ref to=\"2JN.1.5 1JN.2.24\">5; 1Jo 2:24</ref></p>"}
{"from":"1:7","body":"<p>many.<br/><ref to=\"2PE.2.1-2PE.2.3 1JN.2.18-1JN.2.22 1JN.4.1\">2Pe 2:1-3; 1Jo 2:18-22; 4:1</ref><br/>who.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.1.14 1TI.3.16 1JN.4.2 REV.12.9 REV.13.14\">Joh 1:14; 1Ti 3:16; 1Jo 4:2; Re 12:9; 13:14</ref><br/>This is.<br/><ref to=\"1JN.2.22 1JN.4.3\">1Jo 2:22; 4:3</ref></p>"}
{"from":"1:8","body":"<p>Look.<br/><ref to=\"MAT.24.4 MAT.24.24 MAT.24.25 MRK.13.5 MRK.13.6 MRK.13.9 MRK.13.23 LUK.21.8 HEB.12.15 REV.3.11\">Mt 24:4,24,25; Mr 13:5,6,9,23; Lu 21:8; Heb 12:15; Re 3:11</ref><br/>that we lose.<br/><ref to=\"GAL.3.4 GAL.4.11 PHP.2.15 PHP.2.16 PHP.3.16 HEB.10.32 HEB.10.35 REV.3.11\">Ga 3:4; 4:11; Php 2:15,16; 3:16; Heb 10:32,35; Re 3:11</ref><br/>wrought. or, gained.\"Some copies read, which ye have gained, but that ye receive, etc.\"<br/>that we receive.<br/><ref to=\"DAN.12.3 JHN.4.36 1CO.3.8 1CO.3.14 1CO.15.8\">Da 12:3; Joh 4:36; 1Co 3:8,14; 15:8</ref></p>"}
{"from":"1:9","body":"<p>abideth not.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.15.6 1JN.2.22-1JN.2.24\">Joh 15:6; 1Jo 2:22-24</ref><br/>the doctrine.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.7.16 JHN.7.17 ACT.2.42 COL.3.16 TIT.2.10 HEB.6.1\">Joh 7:16,17; Ac 2:42; Col 3:16; Tit 2:10; Heb 6:1</ref><br/>hath not.<br/><ref to=\"MAT.11.27 LUK.10.22 JHN.5.23 JHN.14.6\">Mt 11:27; Lu 10:22; Joh 5:23; 14:6</ref><br/>He that.<br/><ref to=\"HEB.3.14\">Heb 3:14</ref><br/>he hath.<br/><ref to=\"1JN.1.3\">1Jo 1:3</ref></p>"}
