{"from":"1:12","body":"<p>many.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.16.12\">Joh 16:12</ref><br/>I would.<br/><ref to=\"3JN.1.13\">3Jo 1:13</ref><br/>I trust.<br/><ref to=\"ROM.15.24 1CO.16.5-1CO.16.7 PHM.1.22 HEB.13.19 HEB.13.23\">Ro 15:24; 1Co 16:5-7; Phm 1:22; Heb 13:19,23</ref><br/>face to face. Gr. mouth to mouth.<br/><ref to=\"NUM.12.8\">Nu 12:8</ref><br/>that.<br/><ref to=\"JHN.15.11 JHN.16.24 JHN.17.13 2TI.1.4 1JN.1.4\">Joh 15:11; 16:24; 17:13; 2Ti 1:4; 1Jo 1:4</ref><br/>our. or, your.</p>"}
